  "description": "SC-011 deterministic replay evidence. Each case carries the frozen experiment, score, analysis, and decision bundles for one calibration comparison pair, and replay reconstructs the terminal decision from the recorded evidence rather than reading it back from the committed bundle. Bounded to six cases so suite cost does not scale with accumulated campaign evidence (FR-057). Every partition here is calibration and qualification-ineligible, so no case can reach the qualified terminal member (FR-024). Contains no raw captures, no account or authentication material, no absolute paths, and no session identifiers (FR-027, FR-036).",
  "analysis_plan_note": "analysis_plan below is a SYNTHETIC replay artifact whose numeric content exercises the decision code paths. It is deliberately NOT the authoritative frozen analysis plan of FR-023 and FR-038, which freezes only after the operator calibration pilot supplies its variance estimates and is published separately under docs/ai/research/.",
